<!--
  ============================================================================
  DroidFemaleTexture_Fix.xml                 Jawa_Patches · authored 2026-08-10
  ============================================================================

  THE BUG
  =======
  A female protocol droid renders with NO BODY, just a magenta placeholder.
  Observed live 2026-08-10; the log says exactly why:

      Failed to find any textures at OuterRim/Droid/Protocol/Body/Naked_Female
      while constructing Multi(initPath=OuterRim/Droid/Protocol/Body/Naked_Female...)

  ROOT CAUSE  [VERIFIED 2026-08-10]
  =================================
  Outer Rim Droid Depot (Neronix17.OuterRim.DroidDepot, WS 3096501398) ships
  ONLY male body textures. Every droid body folder was checked:

      B1  B1A  B2  BX  HK  ImperialLabor  KX  Magnaguard  Protocol
      SuperTactical  Tactical

  All 11 contain Naked_Male_{north,south,east}.png and no Female variant at all.
  So this is not a Protocol Droid bug, it is every droid in the mod. Protocol is
  simply the one that got spawned, and it is also the only race that explicitly
  declares <hasGenders>true</hasGenders>, which is why it rolls female at all.

  THE FIX
  =======
  Force every affected PawnKindDef to Male so generation only ever asks for a
  texture that exists. Droids having a gender is meaningless flavour anyway.

  Chose fixedGender on the PawnKindDef over hasGenders=false on the race
  deliberately: with hasGenders false RimWorld generates Gender.None, and the
  body path would then resolve to Naked_None, which does not exist either. That
  would turn one broken droid into every droid broken. fixedGender routes to the
  Male textures that are known to be present.

  SAFETY
  ======
  Each op is conditional on the pawnkind existing AND not already declaring
  fixedGender, so it no-ops if Droid Depot ships female art or sets the field
  upstream. Add-if-missing shape, so test and inner xpath differ by design.

  VERIFY AFTER THE NEXT LOAD
  ==========================
    * GONE: "Failed to find any textures at OuterRim/Droid/*/Body/Naked_Female"
    * Spawn several droids of each kind; none should have a magenta body.
  ============================================================================
-->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_HKDroid"][not(fixedGender)]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_HKDroid"][not(fixedGender)]</xpath>
      <value>
        <fixedGender>Male</fixedGender>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_ImperialLaborDroid"][not(fixedGender)]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_ImperialLaborDroid"][not(fixedGender)]</xpath>
