       🔑 WHY A PATCH AND NOT THE GENERATOR. gen_pawnkind_roster.py builds
       JawaFactionRoster.xml and the rule belongs there. It cannot go there
       today: MEASURED 2026-08-23, regenerating that file REVERTS the
       stormtrooper lockdown (weaponMoney 950~1150 -> 650~780, ORImperialLight
       back in, apparelTags widened from ImperialStormtrooper to the 21-carrier
