       generator has diverged from the file the same way gen_races_mod.py has.
       Putting the rule here keeps ONE file responsible for the whole
       male-only-droid-art rule, which is defensible on its own merits, and
       costs nothing if the generator is ever reconciled - these ops carry
       [not(fixedGender)] and become no-ops the moment the field is emitted.
       Reconciling it is RACES_GENERATOR_DIVERGED_1's sibling and is filed as
